	'k10803cac' => 'Front of house manager Jonas Berg oversees our box office operations, ticket allocations, and volunteer ushers, greeting audiences from 18:30 each evening. Aisha Rahman directs our under-26 and schools programme, coordinating subsidized student matinees, study guides, and ticket access for young people across Easthaven. Central to our work is our resident acting ensemble, consisting of eight professional actors hired for the entire September-to-May season. By rehearsing future titles while performing current ones, the ensemble develops the shared vocabulary and artistic trust essential to authentic repertory theatre.',
