	'k3b004415' => 'Since opening our doors in 2009, Butai Playhouse has grown steadily through deliberate, focused investments in theatrical craft. In 2014, we completed the construction of our dedicated rehearsal room and carpentry workshop, enabling the company to rehearse new titles while existing productions were staged. In 2019, we introduced our under-26 season pass and schools initiative, making thirty-two-euro previews and ninety-five-euro full season passes available to young theatergoers. In 2024, we completely renewed the seating throughout the stalls, improving acoustic sightlines while preserving our intimate two-hundred-seat capacity.',
