	'k3bb2b5ec' => 'Production, Design, and Technical Leadership',
	'k3ca3fbb7' => 'Our auditorium seats exactly two hundred people across a steeply raked configuration that ensures clear sightlines from every angle. The stalls accommodate one hundred and forty seats arranged across rows A through J, with fourteen seats per row. The circle provides sixty additional seats across rows K, L, and M, with twenty seats per row. Because our end-on stage measures 9.5 meters wide, no audience member sits more than eleven rows from the performers. Four dedicated wheelchair spaces are located in row J of the stalls, providing level, step-free access directly from the ground floor foyer.',
	'k3dfd9dcf' => 'Play four',
	'k3e4030f9' => 'Subscribers who cannot attend their scheduled performance date may exchange their tickets for another performance of the same play at no additional charge. We permit one complimentary date swap per title, provided your request reaches the box office at least forty-eight hours prior to curtain. While we cannot hold your usual row and number for swapped dates, Jonas Berg and the front of house team will assign the closest available location in the stalls or circle. Simply email boxoffice@butai-playhouse.example or telephone our counter between 12:00 and 18:00, Tuesday through Saturday, to arrange your alternate evening.',
