	'k7ad153c4' => 'All personal information collected by Butai Playhouse is stored securely with restricted administrative access limited to box office manager Jonas Berg and executive director Margit Ellison. You have the right to request a copy of the personal information we hold about you, request corrections to inaccurate records, or ask for the deletion of your personal data from our systems. For any privacy queries or data requests, please write to our data administrator at hello@butai-playhouse.example or send mail to Butai Playhouse, 14 Lantern Row, Easthaven.',
	'k7afd736a' => 'Renewals, season tickets and single tickets.',
	'k7b023a16' => 'Schools, youth organizations, and community groups planning visits to Butai Playhouse should contact Aisha Rahman, who directs our under-26 and education programmes. We offer discounted student tickets at twenty-four euros for regular performances, as well as thirty-two-euro preview allocations and dedicated post-show discussions with the resident acting ensemble. To book group tickets or arrange an educational workshop in our rehearsal studio, email hello@butai-playhouse.example with your institution details, group size, and preferred dates. We recommend booking school group visits at least four weeks in advance.',
