	'k845985a8' => 'Five plays, the same seat each time',
	'k846e995e' => 'If you subscribe to our monthly newsletter, The Call Sheet, we collect and store only your email address. This address is used exclusively to deliver our monthly dispatch on the first Monday of each month. We do not engage in behavioral ad tracking, cross-site profiling, or data brokering. Your information is never transferred or sold to commercial third parties. You may unsubscribe at any time by selecting the unsubscribe link at the bottom of any email or by writing to our administrative team at hello@butai-playhouse.example.',
	'k8565866b' => 'We produce five plays because our resident company rehearses in one room, building each world for four weeks before performing it on stage. By day the cast works on the next script; by night they play the current run.',
