	'k86e7f51a' => '3 Aug',
	'k870f399e' => 'The Call Sheet arrives in your inbox on the first Monday of every month throughout the year. Edited directly by our co-founders Tomas Reyes and Margit Ellison, each dispatch provides three specific items: advance notice of upcoming season ticket renewals and single-ticket release dates, candid rehearsal dispatches and technical notes from behind the scenes, and one exclusive ticket offer or backstage tour invitation reserved solely for subscribers. We do not send promotional clutter or third-party advertisements; each edition is written to keep regular playgoers connected to the work in progress.',
	'k8783f87b' => 'Behind the auditorium lies our dedicated rehearsal studio, where the resident acting ensemble rehearses the upcoming play by day while the current production runs on stage at night. Adjacent to the rehearsal room, our scenic workshop allows resident designer Rafael Duarte and our carpentry crew to build complete sets on site, from the timber ship decks of Winter Ferry to domestic interiors. Public backstage tours take place every Saturday morning at 11:00. Tickets cost twelve euros and offer an hour-long guided walk through the wings, workshop, and prompt desk, led by our technical team.',
	'k886a655f' => 'Plan your visit',
	'k888006fd' => 'No Monday performances',
